ype":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119045/\u003e","ts":"1628865306.270500","attachments":[{"fallback":"プログラミングTypeScript","id":1,"title":"プログラミングTypeScript","title_link":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119045/","text":"プログラミング言語TypeScriptの解説書。TypeScriptの型に関する基礎的な内容からその応用、エラー処理の手法、非同期プログラミング、各種フレームワークの利用法、既存のJavaScriptプロジェクトのTypeScript移行の方法まで、言語全般を総合的に解説します。本書全体を通じて、TypeScriptの洗練された型システムを最大限活用するために、コードをどのように記述すべきか、なぜそうすべきかを学べます。","thumb_url":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/images/picture_large978-4-87311-904-5.jpeg","blocks":null,"service_name":"oreilly.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":516,"thumb_height":660,"from_url":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119045/","original_url":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119045/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cN8J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"000a0fe7-3776-42fc-a5ba-30b2d96775c3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Web1.0 の頃のJSは知ってるから、TSだけ頑張ってる","ts":"1628865301.270200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o+Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2675bf23-20b5-4578-8a9a-d454bf498680","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"並行してやるのがよさそう","ts":"1628865283.269500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8CGw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"295a5312-9fb9-4633-a6d3-c28e93e0ad06","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"TSナニもワカラナイ","ts":"1628865266.268900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vz6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"757874ed-7fb4-48bb-ac95-43459247b4cc","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあ JS から学んだほうが本当はいいのは間違いないんでしょうけどねー。モチベの問題が…","ts":"1628865262.268700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[